1
00:00:15,578 --> 00:00:17,047
So what time are we getting up tomorrow?

2
00:00:17,048 --> 00:00:18,388
- Yes, we need to know. - Right.

3
00:00:18,688 --> 00:00:21,787
Tomorrow, we're going to split into two teams...

4
00:00:21,788 --> 00:00:23,257
- for work. - Oh, my gosh.

5
00:00:23,258 --> 00:00:24,358
- Really? - Again?

6
00:00:25,488 --> 00:00:26,657
(This time)

7
00:00:26,658 --> 00:00:29,898
We'll split into Team Sea...

8
00:00:30,028 --> 00:00:31,767
and Team Land for work.

9
00:00:31,768 --> 00:00:34,098
There will be two people on Team Sea,

10
00:00:34,538 --> 00:00:35,867
and there will be three people on Team Land.

11
00:00:35,868 --> 00:00:37,908
Oh, I guess the boat can only hold two of us.

12
00:00:38,508 --> 00:00:39,938
Team Sea...

13
00:00:40,308 --> 00:00:42,778
